<title>USA: Murdock hires investment banker.</title>
<headline>Murdock hires investment banker.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Murdock Communications Corp said Wednesday it has hired Blalock &amp; Co, investment bankers, to provide advice regarding growth strategies and financing alternatives.</p>
<p>&quot;William Blalock, president of Blalock &amp; Company, provides a special expertise which will assist us in developing and evaluating growth strategies, acquisition candidates and financing alternatives,&quot; Guy Murdock, chairman of the provider of telecommunications systems for the lodging industry, said.</p>
<p>Murdock shares rose 1/4 to three Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
